{"product_id":"liplegging-sonna","title":"Liplegging SONNA","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA legging de compressão 4D feita para o corpo com lipedema.\u003c\/strong\u003e Compressão graduada de 15 a 21 mmHg, mais firme no tornozelo, e tecido 4D de micromassagem que estimula a drenagem a cada passo.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDesincha e alivia o peso e a dor nas pernas\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEmpina o bumbum e modela a silhueta\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRespirável e antiodor, não pinica e não marca\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCós alto que não enrola\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e90% poliamida e 10% elastano\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SONNA","offers":[{"title":"Preta \/ P","offer_id":51349005041903,"sku":null,"price":249.9,"currency_code":"BRL","in_stock":true},{"title":"Preta \/ M","offer_id":51349005074671,"sku":null,"price":249.9,"currency_code":"BRL","in_stock":true},{"title":"Preta \/ G","offer_id":51349005107439,"sku":null,"price":249.9,"currency_code":"BRL","in_stock":true},{"title":"Preta \/ GG","offer_id":51349005140207,"sku":null,"price":249.9,"currency_code":"BRL","in_stock":true},{"title":"Preta \/ XGG","offer_id":51349005172975,"sku":null,"price":249.9,"currency_code":"BRL","in_stock":true},{"title":"Preta \/ G1","offer_id":51349688287471,"sku":null,"price":249.9,"currency_code":"BRL","in_stock":true},{"title":"Preta \/ G2","offer_id":51349688320239,"sku":null,"price":249.9,"currency_code":"BRL","in_stock":true},{"title":"Preta \/ G3","offer_id":51349688353007,"sku":null,"price":249.9,"currency_code":"BRL","in_stock":true},{"title":"Vinho \/ P","offer_id":51349005205743,"sku":null,"price":249.9,"currency_code":"BRL","in_stock":true},{"title":"Vinho \/ M","offer_id":51349005238511,"sku":null,"price":249.9,"currency_code":"BRL","in_stock":true},{"title":"Vinho \/ G","offer_id":51349005271279,"sku":null,"price":249.9,"currency_code":"BRL","in_stock":true},{"title":"Vinho \/ GG","offer_id":513